## Import

Import is supported using the following syntax:

```shell
# import using the user slug from the URL:
# https://dashboard.doppler.com/workplace/[workplace-slug]/team/users/[user-slug]
terraform import doppler_project_member_user_role_assignment.default <project-name>.workplace_user.<user-slug>.<role-identifier>
```
